1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,016
Aai, Mumbai mein naukri dhoondhte-dhoondhte chappal ghis gayi.

2
00:00:04,316 --> 00:00:08,446
Ganesh, Mumbai chalti hai vada pav pe! Station ke bahar stall laga!

3
00:00:08,746 --> 00:00:11,475
Vada pav? 20 rupaye mein kya bachega, Aai?

4
00:00:11,775 --> 00:00:14,898
Kadhai, gas, thela aur permission. 30 hazaar mein shuru.

5
00:00:15,198 --> 00:00:19,340
Meri sookhi laal chutney ki recipe le ja. Wahi tera secret hoga!

6
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:23,577
Bhau, jaldi do vada pav! 8:20 ki local pakadni hai!

7
00:00:23,877 --> 00:00:26,654
Ye lo sahab, garam-garam. 20 rupaye ka ek!

8
00:00:26,954 --> 00:00:31,550
Ek ki laagat 8-10 rupaye. Roz 300 bike, to 3 hazaar ki bachat.

9
00:00:31,850 --> 00:00:36,274
Saath mein chai aur samosa pav bhi rakh. Subah-shaam ki bheed dono pakad.

10
00:00:36,574 --> 00:00:39,697
Ganesh Vada Pav, station ka hero! Life set!
